      "why_min_track": "every class is 0.2 mm or wider; 0.15 leaves room for Freerouting's rounding",
      "why_clearance": "0.15 mm default (as ice_core): the PCA9306's VSSOP-8 land has 0.15 mm between its 0.35 mm pads at 0.5 mm pitch, so 0.2 mm failed DRC on the footprint itself and Freerouting would not enter it (2026-10-02: 26 open, U7 clearance rows); the power classes keep 0.2 mm"
    },
